        "html": "\n<p>All information on team training can be found in the real estate dashboard &mdash; see the <strong>Team Dashboard &rsaquo; Roster &amp; Compliance</strong> tab on this page.</p>\n<p>There are columns for Verifiable and Non-Verifiable Training hours. Anyone highlighted in green has completed their 10-hour requirement; anyone in red has not. Each broker must have all their training completed by 31 December.</p>\n<p>On 1 December, send all brokers a reminder that they must complete their verifiable training by 31 December. The onus is on the brokers to complete their training.</p>\n<p>For verifiable training, Colliers hires trainer David Palfreyman (<a href=\"tel:+64215172272\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">+64 21 51 7272</a>, <a href=\"mailto:info@davidpalfreyman.co.nz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">info@davidpalfreyman.co.nz</a>) to come into the office and help the brokers complete their 10 hours of verifiable training. This is paid for by Colliers.</p>\n<p>Anna enters all non-verifiable and verifiable training for the brokers into the log spreadsheet &mdash; <a href=\"https://cjch.sharepoint.com/sites/Admin/Shared%20Documents/OPERATIONS/REA/MAIN%20REAA%20SPREADSHEET.xlsx?web=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MAIN REAA SPREADSHEET (SharePoint)</a>, tabs Non-verifiable 2026 and Verifiable 2026.</p>\n<p class=\"noteBox\">Each year the real estate dashboard spreadsheet needs to be updated to reference the new tabs in the log spreadsheet.</p>\n",
