        "html": "\n<p>All team members' PDP plans and review documents can be found in <a href=\"https://cjch.sharepoint.com/:f:/r/sites/Admin/Shared%20Documents/Accounts/Payroll/Current%20Employees?d=w9a4f5c2385395ce399e2539d21022dcd&csf=1&web=1&e=vkc6sO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">this folder (SharePoint)</a>.</p>\n<p>Employee reviews happen twice a year. During June, reviews for employees are conducted using <a href=\"https://cjch.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/Admin/Shared%20Documents/OPERATIONS/BUSINESS%20PLANS/Business%20Plan%202026_Template%20Support%20Staff%20(Blank).pdf?d=wa2f33cd4c80e440eac095f163cc5d0bd&csf=1&web=1&e=0VQ8vM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">this form (SharePoint)</a>. Note: this review is not a pay review.</p>\n<p>Pay reviews happen during December and are conducted by the Office Manager (Anna) for the marketing team, reception and the EA. COO, Financial Manager and Office Manager reviews are conducted by the GM.</p>\n<p>Agent Mid-Year and End-of-Year review documentation can be found <a href=\"https://cjch.sharepoint.com/:f:/r/sites/Admin/Shared%20Documents/OPERATIONS/REVIEWS?d=w46e1a343572248eeb5a21e8f1d396bc6&csf=1&web=1&e=gJvY7i\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here (SharePoint)</a>, and the financial information is updated by the Finance Manager and passed to the Business Unit Manager to conduct the 1:1 with the broker.</p>\n<p>HR information regarding templates and issues can be found <a href=\"https://cjch.sharepoint.com/:f:/r/sites/Admin/Shared%20Documents/OPERATIONS/HR?d=wbb475742befd464087947c168a6b8659&csf=1&web=1&e=UJB2pk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here (SharePoint)</a>.</p>\n",
