        "html": "\n<p>The commercial listing and leasing checklist is stored under <code>Broker Tool Kit &ndash; Documents\\AGENCY AGREEMENTS - NEW\\Commercial_Listing_Leasing_Checklist_JW.docx</code> on the local network.</p>\n<p>All agency listing and leasing documents can be found under <code>\\Broker Tool Kit &ndash; Documents\\Agency Agreements &ndash; New\\</code>.</p>\n",
        "text": "The commercial listing and leasing checklist is stored under Broker Tool Kit – Documents\\AGENCY AGREEMENTS - NEW\\Commercial_Listing_Leasing_Checklist_JW.docx on the local network. All agency listing and leasing documents can be found under \\Broker Tool Kit – Documents\\Agency Agreements – New\\ ."
