        "id": "4-9",
        "num": "4.9",
        "title": "Training for new Brokers",
        "html": "\n<p>New brokers are supervised by their line manager for the first 6 months &mdash; any appraisal, listing, inspection or contract needs to be reviewed by the line manager, who should where practicable accompany the new broker and coach them at the coal face.</p>\n<p>Role playing scenarios are another way for brokers to learn real-world situations. A Copilot AI prompt document is available (<code>Admin - Documents\\OPERATIONS\\TRAINING\\Role Play Prompts - Copilot\\copilot role play prompts for new agents - JW.docx</code>) that can be shared with new and inexperienced brokers to hone their skills. Best practice is to use these AI prompts prior to going to the appointment &mdash; preparation and practice is key to success.</p>\n",
        "text": "New brokers are supervised by their line manager for the first 6 months — any appraisal, listing, inspection or contract needs to be reviewed by the line manager, who should where practicable accompany the new broker and coach them at the coal face. Role playing scenarios are another way for brokers to learn real-world situations. A Copilot AI prompt document is available ( Admin - Documents\\OPERATIONS\\TRAINING\\Role Play Prompts - Copilot\\copilot role play prompts for new agents - JW.docx ) that can be shared with new and inexperienced brokers to hone their skills. Best practice is to use these AI prompts prior to going to the appointment — preparation and practice is key to success."
