        "html": "\n<p><a href=\"https://cjch.sharepoint.com/sites/Admin/Shared%20Documents/OPERATIONS/HEALTH%20AND%20SAFETY/Health%20and%20Safety%20Policy%20December%20Master.doc?web=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Colliers Health and Safety Policy (SharePoint)</a></p>\n<p>When a new person starts, this is emailed to them by Anna. It contains all accident/emergency procedures for the office and the health and safety policy. Anna takes new starters through the emergency procedures for the Colliers High St office when they start.</p>\n",
